	First, a response to the recent queries about spellbooks in statues
Yes, you can find spellbooks in statues.  I have found many just today.  Just
apply a pickaxe at the statue.  I'd say about 1 in 10 has a spellbook inside.
(someone with the source could give you a better idea).  I may be wrong, but
I seem to find more as a Knight than I did as a Samuri, so it might have  
something to do with character class (though I doubt it).

	Now, for my question...  How do you wish for an artifact.  I tried
to wish for Excaliber and a "a" sword named Excaliber, not "the" sword.  Also,
is there a list of Artifacts for NH3.1.1?  As a knight, I figured that I would
recieve Excal for finishing my quest, but no luck.  Just got a really nice
mirror. :)

Happy exploring!

